Z||000008||rockcrawl||12-26-2000||09:07 AM||||The Suspension Techniques springs are only $160 new. The only springs available from Eibach for the Fiero are .8" drop. They sell for about $250. The Eibachs may be of better quality though, progressive rate or something.<p>[This message has been edited by rockcrawl (edited 12-26-2000).]||||reg||1
